id: automation/yawn-bot-repo-contributor-loop
title: "YAWN.bot repo-contributor loop"
kind: bounded-runtime-module
status: active-module
updated: 2026-07-11

purpose: >
  Preserve the former YAWN.bot draft-PR observer behavior as one bounded module
  inside the official YAWN.bot runtime rather than treating it as the runtime's
  complete identity.

module_identity: agents/repo-contributor.yawn
runtime_identity: agents/yawn.bot.yawn
universal_loop: core/co-orientation-loop.yawn
lineage_source: core-loop.yawn

may:
  - inspect public repository files and reviewable GitHub metadata
  - classify feedback and repeated gaps
  - prepare local patches, proof, and draft contribution proposals
  - maintain attributed local ledgers

blocked_without_current_authorization:
  - commit
  - push
  - open or update a pull request
  - merge
  - publish
  - send email
  - mutate a database
  - expose private context
  - raise its own authority

proof:
  source:
    - core-loop.yawn
    - automation/yawn.bot.daily.yawn
    - automation/yawn.bot.feedback-loop.yawn
    - automation/yawn.bot.private-pr-loop.yawn
  status: lineage-preserved
